| K | 16, 32 | 17, 31 | 14, 29 | 15, 30 |
| 1 | 16, 32 | 19, 30 | 15, 29 | 14, 31 |
| 2 | 15 to 16, 32 | 18 to 19, 29 | 20, 28 | 14, 31 |
